// Stubs for the runtime/trace package.
//
// No context: Moxie's cancellation is a breaker channel carried over a spawn
// channel, and every function here is a no-op, so a ctx parameter would be
// accepted and ignored. Taking it out also removes the only caller of
// context.TODO, which let that function go with it.
